# The pre-Astro site served flat .html files, so /partners.html and /impressum.html
# were live URLs. Astro now emits directory-style pages, so those paths need to be
# sent to their new homes. The extensionless forms (/partners, /impressum) are handled
# by Cloudflare's auto-trailing-slash asset handling and do not need a rule here.
/partners.html   /partners/    301
/impressum.html  /impressum/   301
/index.html      /             301
